import ../../../ui/native.dl
import application.dl

seed the random number generator with the current time
build the breakout program
set session to a new arcade session
set interface to an instance of lexi arcade with state (the address of session)
bind (the control labeled "Screen" in (the address of interface)) in (the address of interface) to (the function named "paint breakout on $") for event 1
set view to a desktop view of (the address of interface) sized 1200 by 780 using fonts "assets/fonts/NotoSans-Regular.ttf" and "assets/fonts/NotoSans-SemiBold.ttf"
set view's theme's accent to UI ink 255 196 98
play breakout using the address of view
close the address of view
close the address of interface
close the address of session
